.12"},null]}],"nop","\n","^You can always reach out to me when you feel that way. You know I’m still here whenever you need someone right? ",{"#":"Speaker: Amika"},"\n","^“Here” being across the country? ",{"#":"Speaker: Emerald"},"\n","^Jk lol ",{"#":"Speaker: Emerald"},"\n","^Emerald, do you think things would be better if I hadn’t moved away? ",{"#":"Speaker: Amika"},"\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-7"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-7":["^Are you asking me if I feel abandoned? ",{"#":"Speaker: Emerald"},"\n","^Would you really tell me if I didn’t ask? ",{"#":"Speaker: Amika"},"\n","^I mean I do feel alone a lot. ",{"#":"Speaker: Emerald"},"\n","^I still think of you as my best friend but once we went to college we couldn’t talk and hang out every day like we used to ",{"#":"Speaker: Emerald"},"\n",["ev",{"^->":"Texting_Sequence_2.0.g-7.12.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-20","flg":18},{"s":["^I didn’t realize that ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Texting_Sequence_2.0.g-7.13.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-21","flg":18},{"s":["^I’m so sorry Emerald. ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-20":["ev",{"^->":"Texting_Sequence_2.0.g-7.c-20.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.12.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],{"#":"Speaker: Amika"},"\n","^Oh I’m sorry Amika… I could have tried reaching out more too ",{"#":"Speaker: Emerald"},"\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-8"},{"#f":5}],"c-21":["ev",{"^->":"Texting_Sequence_2.0.g-7.c-21.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.13.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],{"#":"Speaker: Amika"},"\n","^No no we’ve both had a lot of change lately ",{"#":"Speaker: Emerald"},"\n","^I feel guilty that we haven’t talked in so long ",{"#":"Speaker: Amika"},"\n",{"->":".^.^.^.g-8"},{"#f":5}],"#f":5}],"g-8":["^When I got busy I just assumed you were living it up in college and booking shows and didn’t need me anymore. ",{"#":"Speaker: Amika"},"\n","^I should have asked you how you felt about that! ",{